		{
			dependencies: ["0D8DD9023CE3566F"]
			description: ["&fUmvuthi, the Sunbird, is a major boss found in the Umvuthana Grove. He channels solar power to strike with Sunstrikes, Solar Flares, and a devastating Solar Beam. His Supernova attack pulls players inward before detonating in a massive blast. When his health drops below 75 percent, he summons Umvuthana Cranes that grant him an unbreakable shield until they are defeated. Prepare strong defenses to survive his magic and claim your victory."]
