			description: ["&fThe Abayuthana are neutral bird like mobs that hunt in packs across the savanna. They are hostile toward players not wearing one of their masks and attack with dangerous diving claw strikes. Defeating these warriors allows you to collect their masks, which provide unique buffs like increased jump height. This task proves your dominance over the savanna."]
